    <string name="about_body">GPS Map Pro is a fast, offline-friendly map and GPS dashboard.\n\nMap data © OpenStreetMap contributors, available under the Open Database License. Tiles are provided by the selected tile source. Search and reverse geocoding use OpenStreetMap Nominatim.\n\nPrivacy: your location, tracks and settings stay on this device. Search text is sent to Nominatim only when you search; no account or analytics are used.\n\nBuilt as an independent remake of gps_map.</string>
